* Decision pattern: search result selection includes a separate disambiguation step.
Goal: Open the correct search result
. Goal: Search for item
.. Look at <search field>
.. Click <search field>
.. Hands to keyboard
.. Type <item name>
.. Keystroke Enter
. Goal: Disambiguate result
.. Search for <item name>
.. Read <result details>
.. Verify <result details> match <item name>
. Goal: Open result
.. Look at <correct result>
.. Click <correct result>
.. Verify <correct result> is open
